{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3HfAaZL1aR2ABUn4KE7gbQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:19.253122+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3HfAaZL1aR2ABUn4KE7gbQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/knwFlYRlyPvrALia3aNiaLROl1RQGVdgGNiasTlJ0xDnP1RZJ3YJxAELxdoy5COXhiaGeKuzq7iak3UslRmiaAdQUnSYUI3OgnribrVd1934vz2KGk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPsC7h3MFXhu7g8vUvtIbaT0Kg20WqpibficelxqPeqn6fFGicfziapeagTnaIv1icZpdrQia7bRr8hyxx2Vktg18xuQJkk7ApzHI1sXg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>华南理工大学经济与金融学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生</span><strong><span><span>推荐免试攻读研究生预报名</span></span></strong><span>现已启动！热忱欢迎具有推荐免试资格，或预计能够获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生报名申请。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>期待更多优秀学子加入华工经金，在</span><span><strong><span>高水平学科平台</span></strong></span><span>上开启新的学术旅程，未来已来，华南理工大学欢迎每一位勇敢的追梦人！</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、学院概况与发展历程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>经济与金融学院位于</span><span><strong><span>广州大学城校区</span></strong></span><span>，拥有应用经济学</span><span><strong><span>一级学科博士点和博士后流动站</span></strong></span><span>、应用经济学</span><span><strong><span>一级学科硕士点</span></strong></span><span>、</span><span><strong><span>金融 MBA、金融 MEM、金融硕士和国际商务硕士专业学位硕士点</span></strong></span><span>的完整学科体系。学院具有厚重的发展历史，1984年即创办工业经济专业并培养硕士，1994年创办国际金融本科专业、1996年创办国际经济与贸易本科专业，2003年设立金融工程与经济发展二级学科博士点，2015年获批应用经济学一级学科博士点。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2、学科建设与人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2024年，华南理工大学经济学与商学进入ESI全球</span><span><strong><span>排名前1%</span></strong></span><span>；经济学入选广东省基础学科拔尖人才培养</span><span><strong><span>创新实验区</span></strong></span><span>。2025年，获批《金融科技时代》期刊（CN:44-1680/N）的主办权</span><span>。学院坚持立德树人，持之以恒培养家国情怀和全球视野兼备、学习力、思想力、行动力 “三力” 卓越的 “三创型”（创新、创造、创业）人才。金融学、经济学为</span><span><strong><span>国家级一流本科专业建设点</span></strong></span><span>，开设了金融科技、经济学创新班（本硕连读）等特色本科专业。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3、师资队伍情况</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院现有专任教师60余人，其中</span><span><strong><span>教授22人</span></strong></span><span>（含二级教授2人）、</span><span><strong><span>副教授26人</span></strong></span><span>，</span><span><strong><span>博士生导师26人</span></strong></span><span>，师资均毕业于</span><strong><span><span>国内外知名学府</span></span></strong><span>，超过50%的教师具有境外学习或工作经历。拥有</span><span><strong><span>国家级高层次人才计划入选者</span></strong></span><span>、原国内贸易部（现商务部）“有突出贡献专家” 和教育部新世纪优秀人才等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4、科研成果与学术交流</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>科研氛围浓郁，近五年承担国家社会科学基金重大、重点、一般项目和国家自然科学基金等国家级项目、部省级项目</span><span><strong><span>300余项</span></strong></span><span>。在知名学术期刊发表学术论文</span><span><strong><span>400多篇</span></strong></span><span>，获高等学校科学研究</span><span><strong><span>优秀成果奖</span></strong></span><span>（人文社会科学）、广东省哲学社会科学</span><span><strong><span>优秀成果奖一等奖</span></strong></span><span>等20余项。建设有广东省普通高校人文社会科学重点研究基地</span><span><strong><span>金融工程研究中心</span></strong></span><span>、广东省普通高校特色新型智库跨境金融创新研究中心、广东省供应链金融工程技术研究中心等</span><span><strong><span>多个重点研究机构</span></strong></span><span>。学术交流活跃，常态举办经济与金融论坛和学术午餐沙龙等学术活动，举办第</span><span><strong><span>21届中国金融学年会</span></strong></span><span>等大型学术会议。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPsUSiaXiagfLR6RDCibZftmcqrDibQl29sMNtDCbgKjTALIuWb5TMOibIdFgaaQibNtlGXVRqSm9ib3qLgZFW8cgKXNdaAvIhnToicVMnI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>重要时间安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、9月15日前</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>完成填报</span><span><strong><span>考生报名信息</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2、9月19日左右</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>现场</span></strong></span><span>面试。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3、9月21日</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>教育部推免系统</span></strong></span><span>正式填报志愿。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPticELwMic1Jw4ibFyJkdTibxsl6LdWGKaNfxVRNYFnISm7vem7uIcak9MWHUbOHP4v17n3NI7ib5qa6R2iaT4ib5vQJ4JthfatibY6x80/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请免试攻读我校2027年研究生均需在华南理工大学研究生（含直博生）预推免报名系统进行</span><span><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></span><span>（含本校推免生）。报名信息提交完成后，下载打印</span><span><strong><span>《华南理工大学2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生（含直博生）申请表》</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPv6hu9emibYHq1A8dj1DqsysIXIWSN0XUV9JMmvPwGbMLQIBsKumK6e7h2WK6j1w2yGs5ALK64WwMoP04eHW8FXF6qMLz2b5jmw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人通过预报名系统提交电子申请资料，包括</span><span><strong><span>学生证、身份证（正反面）、本人近期免冠证件照、本科学习成绩单、英语等级证明</span></strong></span><span>（四六级或者托福雅思）、其他学术论文或获奖证书的扫描件及学院（系）要求提交的其他材料。每个电子版文件采用</span><span><strong><span>PDF文件</span></strong></span><span>格式，文件大小</span><span><strong><span>不超过2M</span></strong></span><span>为宜。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPvG6RHo4zoZkszfhCtmqkRGAiasicwUkd2gLXiaavEB85pT6pD34RkibGQTMNKYNumTuGDVYkw3UMvAaCP78hrVAFEjH9RCicOacDYw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>将于</span><span><strong><span>9月中旬</span></strong></span><span>起陆续开始复试资格审核（分批动态审核，复试名单审核结果以学院通知为准），请意向申请考生务必在</span><span><strong><span>9月15日前</span></strong></span><span>在我校预报名系统完成报名工作。申请人可于</span><span><strong><span>9月中下旬起陆续在我校预报名系统查询</span></strong></span><span>是否获得复试资格。接收学院（系）将依据申请人提交的申请材料对考生学业水平、科</span><span><span>研能力、综合素质和一贯表现等方面进行全面考察，综合确定进入复试考生名单。获得复</span></span><span>试资格的申请人在我校</span><span><strong><span>预报名系统下载《复试通知书》</span></strong></span><span>，并按学院（系）规定的时间参加复试。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPsxCUApVByjg16E3obevq9n6ibCMib4p8VXI1IyaZyryaTaU8S1ObHPmp9rsow18BasiapicxRtic77uNicjhAuwJmRMpNic11jE168pk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人复试时须提交核验材料：（1）《华南理工大学2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生（含直博生）申请表》(</span><span><strong><span>可不用本科学校盖章</span></strong></span><span>)；（2）历年在校学习成绩单</span><span><strong><span>（应加盖推荐学校教务部门或学院（系）公章</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong></span><span>、学生证、身份证原件；（3）大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单原件；（4）其他能证明自身学习、科研、工作方面突出成绩（如获奖证书复印件及申请人提交的体现本人学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）的材料（该部分材料不作为必须提供材料内容，仅供我校审核、接收时参考）；（5）申请学院（系）要求提供的其他材料。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>5、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPtqbjRML0YcqlVbdDOXyNNLcNwHvjdvwxQ1RLiclvJhY0gdmcGcaRIs41ibHsZMyEicnrfCibjAvaVpc5EXUUv7OsrxSZ5Xvk2Ugk0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>通过我校复试并拟接收为推荐免试研究生的考生，必须按照学院（系）</span><span><strong><span>规定时间</span></strong></span><span>在教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址:http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm)填报我校。我校将在系统功能开通后通过“推免服务系统”向进入学院（系）复试名单的考生发送“复试通知”；向通过学院（系）复试进入拟录取名单且已在“推免服务系统”接受“复试通知”的考生发送“待录取通知”，考生必须在学院（系）规定的时间内（</span><span><strong><span>最长不超过24小时</span></strong></span><span>）通过“</span><span><strong><span>推免服务系统”予以确认</span></strong></span><span>，否则视为放弃拟录取资格，请密切关注各学院（系）发布的相关通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPtx2qZX8ZAHgzrvyvkUptHf9lwticbic8UDiaDiak175FIMzO4cZyT7r8dnZuFHNbJPSp0LBQo5hgxdTyGxFPDVehlwPntoDvLGvac/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律、诚实守信，身体健康状况符合规定体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPtI7lpCIM0QtZoibAJc0diawksqGYRGRleQkb4qlkTxx6RHgWLcGqE0SiaMnNRgw4PCCnlac5716gqltBibYcHAO4aGXxfoaR6S2zM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>符合教育部</span><span><strong><span>推荐</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>免试规定条件</span></strong></span><span>的优秀应届本科毕业生，可获得本科就读学校的推荐免试资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPs0VmToicvD5qY0xHRdZ1L9ibl8fTkmIxiczVXgZ3tp4KzwcZo9lBDGcJambkJC5Ixwkkbw1YcxYnfHY0uMUYr9gutJeiaD8UBneXM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>在校期间各方面表现良好，具备作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质和基础。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPsGO2Inyk4oUXcpGuaQicaZCQhI6rQRWLMvQEvoaDREdxZsXicuia7FOEyaicDvMF6juagcf7QcjpRSX0Aicicts3RPLJf5J7icFD3c8A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>符合“退役大学生士兵”计划报考条件的推荐免试生可在报考我校免试生时选择</span><span><strong><span>“退役大学生士兵”专项计划</span></strong></span><span>。报考“退役大学生士兵”专项硕士研究生招生计划的考生，应为</span><span><strong><span>高校学生应征入伍退出现役</span></strong></span><span>，且符合我校硕士研究生报考条件者。高校学生指入伍时为全日制普通本专科（含高职）、研究生、第二学士学位的应（往）届毕业生、在校生和入学新生，以及成人高校招收的普通本专科（高职）应（往）届毕业生、在校生和入学新生。若申请“退役大学生士兵”计划的考生多于专项招生计划数，原则上每个学院可录取该专项计划不超过1人。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>5、</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPuICGWCIKO8KjdnjrNpZKXdySAY7yQbZqKel5Y9CicicpOqDHxnlLOVKkRkKKNSWlUjS5vVQu4bIyq2nicQibMiaZZfU6jhVShicCHV8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>符合接收学院（系）推免生接收方案中要求的其他条件。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电话</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/knwFlYRlyPthMhict8X8T9gApUtrKqV25XeQmiaLoa7GWfnVzLDM48ibiaNLpR9P8PiatIQQ9icGstuwJ57syqYwxjGib2yGxBrPlPV8mQic4ctLHxw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>郜老师 020-81182349</span></p><p><span>范老师 020-81182353</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section><